1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,820
Your agent can build almost anything.
你的 Agent 几乎什么都能做。

2
00:00:02,820 --> 00:00:05,440
But it still picks one model for everything.
但它还是用同一个模型包办所有任务。

3
00:00:07,810 --> 00:00:11,310
A frontier model to classify a support ticket,
一个全能模型，却用来给客服工单分类，

4
00:00:11,310 --> 00:00:14,400
to generate a barrel prop, to draft a thumbnail.
生成油桶道具、做缩略图。

5
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:16,890
Most of that spend is wasted.
大部分钱都花错了地方。

6
00:00:18,090 --> 00:00:21,600
This is ModelPick. A decision layer that picks the best value
ModelPick 只做一件事：挑出最合适的模型——

7
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:23,270
at every node.
在每个节点。

8
00:00:23,490 --> 00:00:26,200
Not the cheapest — the best price-performance,
不是最便宜，而是性价比最高，

9
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:29,350
and prices it in cost per solved task.
并且按成功任务来算钱。

10
00:00:30,150 --> 00:00:35,800
Inside Claude Code, ask for a game-ready 3D asset. ModelPick
在 Claude Code 里要一把 Unity 可用的 3D 剑。ModelPick

11
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:40,000
compares Tripo, Hunyuan, and Meshy, applies the constraints,
会对比 Tripo、混元、Meshy，套用约束，

12
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,210
and returns one recommendation with the real cost.
给出一个带真实成本的推荐。

13
00:00:44,710 --> 00:00:46,930
Twenty-one cents per usable asset.
每个可用资产 0.21 美元。

14
00:00:47,670 --> 00:00:51,050
For a launch video, it plans the whole pipeline.
做一条发布视频，它会把整条流水线排好。

15
00:00:51,050 --> 00:00:54,170
Script, keyframes, clips, voice, music.
脚本、关键帧、视频、配音、音乐。

16
00:00:54,170 --> 00:00:58,130
Five models, one budget, before a single frame renders.
五个模型，一个预算，在渲染第一帧前就定好。

17
00:01:00,580 --> 00:01:03,500
One command installs it into Codex, Cursor,
一条命令接进 Codex、Cursor，

18
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:06,100
DeepSeek Harness, or Copilot.
以及 DeepSeek Harness、Copilot。

19
00:01:06,100 --> 00:01:09,600
A CLI, an MCP server, and a skill.
CLI、MCP 和 skill 都有。

20
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:11,780
No gateway. No keys stored.
不需要网关，也不保存密钥。

21
00:01:13,540 --> 00:01:18,360
Every price has a source. Every decision is benchmarked.
每个价格都有出处，每个推荐都有测试。

22
00:01:18,360 --> 00:01:22,340
And the entire catalog is a JSON file you can change.
整个目录就是一个你能改的 JSON 文件。

23
00:01:23,620 --> 00:01:28,120
ModelPick. Stop paying frontier prices for non-frontier work.
ModelPick。别再拿最贵的模型做最简单的事。

24
00:01:28,540 --> 00:01:31,180
Open source. MIT. On GitHub.
开源，MIT，GitHub 见。
